      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MOSS prompt enhancer\n\n1. Write your idea in **Your idea**.\n2. **MOSS Enhancer System Prompt** tells the LLM how to write a MOSS layout or caption. Keep its width/height equal to **MOSS Compile Prompt**'s caption size.\n3. **Generate Text** (the MOSS text encoder) writes the draft.\n4. **MOSS Compile Prompt** fixes the draft and outputs the prompt plus the width and height. Those feed the latent, so the layout always matches the image size.\n\nRepairs are printed in the console as `MOSS Compile Prompt: ...`. Turn on `strict` to reject bad drafts instead.\n\nModels: [Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image)"
      ],
      "title": "Notes"
    }
